<title>USA: Hewlett-Packard Q2 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Hewlett-Packard Q2 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>PALO ALTO, CALIF., May 15 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		     April 30, 1997     Q2    April 30, 1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.75		     0.69</p>
<p> Net			784,000		  723,000</p>
<p> Revs		  10,340,000		9,880,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     1,046,000		1,055,000</p>
<p>					 6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.62		     1.44</p>
<p> Net		    1,696,000		1,513,000</p>
<p> Revs		  20,635,000	     19,168,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     1,047,000		1,054,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Q2 1997 First Call mean estimate $0.80</p>
<p>Shr and Avg shrs figures reflect the retroactive effect of the company's July 1996 two-for-one stock split.</p>
</text>
